cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the information below."
title: "Fusion Reactor Simulator"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic research and education simulator with reduced 0D power balance and
  1.5D radial transport coupled to fixed-boundary Grad-Shafranov equilibrium. Includes
  error-controlled TR-BDF2, localised events, conservative remapping, exact rewind and
  opt-in pedestal, transport, impurity and fast-ion modules; browser UI, headless library,
  CLI and Python wrapper. Verified against analytic and manufactured solutions and
  benchmarked against published values, with validation where the data allow. Documents
  known reference misses and unmet convergence and predictive-model targets.
